msgstr "抢占北丘"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-first-command.option.rush-north-hill.detail"
msgstr "让托伦提前进入高地，取得位置优势但以受伤状态开局。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-first-command.option.rush-north-hill.consequence"
msgstr "提高“果断”，并真实承担救援成本。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-first-command.option.steady-advance.label"
msgstr "稳步推进"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-first-command.option.steady-advance.detail"
msgstr "保持队形与援护，让帝国前锋先靠近中央村。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-first-command.option.steady-advance.consequence"
msgstr "提高“克制”，保留完整阵线。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.prompt"
msgstr "是否接受凯恩提出的中桥停火？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.context"
msgstr "正式承诺会约束双方三回合，也会让凯恩把你的选择记在程序里。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.option.accept-truce.label"
msgstr "接受停火"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.option.accept-truce.detail"
msgstr "中桥三回合禁止攻击，优先让平民通过。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.option.accept-truce.consequence"
msgstr "凯恩关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.option.no-formal-promise.label"
msgstr "不作承诺"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.option.no-formal-promise.detail"
msgstr "仍可实际停火，但战场不会强制限制攻击。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-bridge-truce.option.no-formal-promise.consequence"
msgstr "敌方更积极，增加独立倾向。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-black-camp-plan.prompt"
msgstr "黑旗营地同时有俘虏和档案，如何分配兵力？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-black-camp-plan.context"
msgstr "两种方案都违背“只侦察”的命令，差别在于把主要风险放在哪里。"

