msgstr "用什么方式解除伊芙拉的锁链？"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.context"
msgstr "两种方式都不控制幼龙，只决定战斗中的工具与路径。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.mirelle-ritual.label"
msgstr "断誓仪式"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.mirelle-ritual.detail"
msgstr "米蕾尔削弱节点，让每处锁链更容易摧毁。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.mirelle-ritual.consequence"
msgstr "米蕾尔关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.break-chain-nodes.label"
msgstr "工兵拆解"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.break-chain-nodes.detail"
msgstr "依靠塔莎和工兵逐处爆破，保留节点结构证据。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-free-ivra.option.break-chain-nodes.consequence"
msgstr "塔莎关系 +1。"

msgid "choice.c01.choice-old-banner-terms.prompt"
msgstr "怎样对待仍站在旧旗之下的士兵？"

